  "name": "Bus Compressor Situations and Styles",
  "author": "Freek van Gool",
  "license": "CC0-1.0",
  "description": "Starting points for Bus Compressor for mixing down and mastering in many music styles and situations: club, festival, big room, home hi-fi, headphones, studio reference, radio and car, plus 32 music styles for streaming. The Situations folder uses a common style for each situation (house for club, EDM for festival and big room, pop for home, headphones, radio, car and streaming, transparent for studio), set a little gentler. Every preset sets its own threshold, ratio, attack, release, knee, parallel mix and make-up (about half of the lost level is brought back); a situation changes how much is compressed, more for radio and big room, less for studio and home. The detector stays internal because the sidechain input needs a cable.",
